        "oci_lb_tls_policy_secure",
        "oci_api_gateway_https_only",
        "oci_backend_tiers_not_publicly_addressable",
        "identity_user_mfa_enabled_console_access"
      ],
      "rationale": "WAF on public load balancers, HTTPS/TLS on load balancers and API gateways, back-end tiers not internet-addressable (multi-tier), and MFA for OCI console users. MFA for the web application's own end users depends on the application's identity provider and needs evidence."
